comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-04T08:45:12.392Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check 2026-08-04: all-status searches covered close_reason_required, create --resolution, recovery examples, context-sensitive retries, and recovery closure. No existing item owns this exact same-command recovery defect; pm-f05lsg owns the measured recovery-closure programme and pm-ykdt4m owns the broader terminal-create contract. GitHub source: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/885"
